569
00:38:51,331 --> 00:38:52,582
Apologies, madam.

570
00:38:54,334 --> 00:38:55,627
But Aemie's my wife.

571
00:38:56,586 --> 00:38:57,687
My house,

572
00:38:57,712 --> 00:38:58,547
my rules.

573
00:38:59,163 --> 00:39:01,498
I have the authority
to kick you out of here

574
00:39:01,758 --> 00:39:03,635
if you don't follow
my house rules.

575
00:39:04,569 --> 00:39:07,238
My daughter will sleep beside me.

576
00:39:08,265 --> 00:39:10,350
You can't do anything about it.

577
00:39:11,601 --> 00:39:14,354
I don't care if this is your house.

578
00:39:15,522 --> 00:39:17,399
I'm your mother-in-law.

579
00:39:17,758 --> 00:39:19,385
I will do what I want.

580
00:39:26,491 --> 00:39:27,576
Ahh, uh.

581
00:39:27,784 --> 00:39:28,743
Ma'am, let's go.

582
00:39:28,743 --> 00:39:30,036
Don't touch me.

583
00:39:50,390 --> 00:39:52,559
Aemie, let's go to sleep.

584
00:39:53,018 --> 00:39:54,352
Oh, okay, Mommy.

585
00:39:54,895 --> 00:39:56,646
Oh, Mommy, let's watch movies.

586
00:39:57,022 --> 00:39:58,781
Then teach me how to act again, okay?

587
00:39:59,107 --> 00:40:00,000
Wife.

588
00:40:02,527 --> 00:40:05,322
I thought you were going
to give me something.

589
00:40:08,366 --> 00:40:09,211
Huh?

590
00:40:09,784 --> 00:40:10,660
Oh!

591
00:40:10,869 --> 00:40:11,828
I almost forgot.

592
00:40:11,828 --> 00:40:13,788
Good thing you reminded me.

593
00:40:14,039 --> 00:40:15,457
Wait, I'll just go get it, okay?

594
00:40:15,790 --> 00:40:17,292
Mommy, I'm just
gonna get something.

595
00:40:17,876 --> 00:40:18,668
Wait.

596
00:40:24,216 --> 00:40:25,047
Please.

597
00:40:43,235 --> 00:40:46,071
So, how's the business, Roswell?

598
00:40:48,114 --> 00:40:49,115
Oh, it's fine.

599
00:40:49,908 --> 00:40:53,036
My wife is putting up
her own toy company.

600
00:40:55,622 --> 00:40:56,998
I'm talking about...

601
00:40:57,832 --> 00:40:59,918
the other business.

602
00:41:06,967 --> 00:41:11,179
Figuring out how to navigate
deals in the face of many problems

603
00:41:11,388 --> 00:41:15,392
and what the future holds is
enough to keep anyone busy.

604
00:41:16,476 --> 00:41:19,062
Strategic plans keep
my business successful.

605
00:41:19,479 --> 00:41:22,274
You need foresight to
be able to do what I do.

606
00:41:22,691 --> 00:41:26,111
Except no one can do what I do but me.

607
00:42:25,295 --> 00:42:27,797
How's your relationship
with your husband?

608
00:42:29,883 --> 00:42:31,801
Oh, Mommy, we're married.

609
00:42:34,554 --> 00:42:35,638
I'm the wife.

610
00:42:35,930 --> 00:42:37,724
And he's the hubby.

611
00:42:38,183 --> 00:42:39,893
But most of the time, he's Dodong.

612
00:43:14,636 --> 00:43:15,720
Are you okay, Mommy?

613
00:43:16,554 --> 00:43:17,555
I'm fine.

614
00:43:19,349 --> 00:43:21,059
Mommy, is it okay if I go ahead?

615
00:43:21,351 --> 00:43:23,186
I'm getting sleepy too.

616
00:43:23,478 --> 00:43:24,771
I'm going back to Zeke's room.

617
00:43:25,563 --> 00:43:26,487
Okay.

618
00:43:27,982 --> 00:43:29,000
Goodnight.

619
00:43:29,025 --> 00:43:30,151
Goodnight, Mommy.

620
00:43:31,569 --> 00:43:32,904
You missed me, didn't you?

621
00:43:33,571 --> 00:43:34,339
Yeah.

622
00:43:34,364 --> 00:43:35,573
Awww, Mommy.

623
00:43:35,573 --> 00:43:36,658
I missed you so much.

624
00:43:39,953 --> 00:43:41,079
Bye-bye. Goodnight.

625
00:43:41,079 --> 00:43:42,073
Goodnight.

626
00:44:10,900 --> 00:44:13,862
You don't have to give me
a baby to be a perfect wife.

627
00:44:14,200 --> 00:44:16,869
Because for me, you
are more than percect

628
00:44:17,087 --> 00:44:18,088
to be my wife.

629
00:44:24,873 --> 00:44:26,374
Hello, guys. Good morning.

630
00:44:26,374 --> 00:44:27,876
But I have a hunch.

631
00:44:28,685 --> 00:44:30,311
Roswell already knows everything.

632
00:44:30,336 --> 00:44:33,298
We can't guarantee her safety
if she's under Roswell's roof.

633
00:44:33,298 --> 00:44:36,176
Especially with how much he hates Yaji.

634
00:44:36,593 --> 00:44:37,760
I'm scared to lose you.

635
00:44:37,969 --> 00:44:39,095
You're probably just hungry.

636
00:44:39,095 --> 00:44:40,930
You're starting to
say all sorts of things.

637
00:44:41,264 --> 00:44:41,906
Come on.

638
00:44:41,931 --> 00:44:43,057
Prepare yourselves.

639
00:44:43,516 --> 00:44:45,143
We'll be having visitors tonight.

640
00:44:45,393 --> 00:44:46,478
Well, guys?

641
00:44:46,769 --> 00:44:47,854
Condolences in advance.

642
00:44:48,480 --> 00:44:49,272
Asshole.

643
00:44:49,814 --> 00:44:50,899
Dong.

644
00:44:51,107 --> 00:44:52,063
Dong.

645
00:44:52,317 --> 00:44:53,293
Dong.

646
00:44:53,318 --> 00:44:54,360
Dong.

647
00:44:54,611 --> 00:44:56,321
Dong, where are you?

648
00:44:56,571 --> 00:44:57,489
Dodong!

649
00:44:57,572 --> 00:44:58,531
Dong.

650
00:44:58,656 --> 00:44:59,727
Where are you, Dong?

651
00:45:01,117 --> 00:45:03,495
Dong.
